<html>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#f4f6f9;color:#1c1c1c;">
<div style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;">

<div style="background:#0070D2;color:#ffffff;padding:24px 32px;">
<div style="font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1px;opacity:0.85;">TECHSTORE B2B</div>
<div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin-top:4px;">Quote Approval Required</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;margin-top:8px;opacity:0.9;">Step pending your approval: <strong>{!ApprovalRequest.Step_Name}</strong></div>
</div>

<div style="padding:24px 32px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;">Hello {!User.FirstName},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">A quote has been submitted for approval and routed to <strong>you</strong> at the <strong>{!ApprovalRequest.Step_Name}</strong> step. Two ways to act on it — pick whichever fits your workflow.</p>

<div style="background:#fff3e0;border:2px solid #ef6c00;padding:14px 18px;margin:16px 0;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;">
<strong>Overall deal tier:</strong> {!Quote.Approval_Tier_Label__c}
</div>

<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;font-size:14px;">
<tr><td style="padding:10px;background:#f4f6f9;width:160px;font-weight:600;">Quote</td><td style="padding:10px;">{!Quote.Name}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px;background:#f4f6f9;font-weight:600;">Account</td><td style="padding:10px;">{!Quote.Account}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px;background:#f4f6f9;font-weight:600;">Quote Number</td><td style="padding:10px;">{!Quote.QuoteNumber}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px;background:#f4f6f9;font-weight:600;">Subtotal</td><td style="padding:10px;">{!Quote.Subtotal}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px;background:#f4f6f9;font-weight:600;">Discount</td><td style="padding:10px;"><strong>{!Quote.Discount}%</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px;background:#f4f6f9;font-weight:600;">Total Price</td><td style="padding:10px;"><strong>{!Quote.TotalPrice}</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px;background:#f4f6f9;font-weight:600;">Grand Total</td><td style="padding:10px;">{!Quote.GrandTotal}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px;background:#f4f6f9;font-weight:600;">Expiration Date</td><td style="padding:10px;">{!Quote.ExpirationDate}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px;background:#f4f6f9;font-weight:600;">Submitted By</td><td style="padding:10px;">{!Quote.LastModifiedBy}</td></tr>
</table>

<div style="background:#e8f5e9;border:2px solid #2e7d32;padding:18px 22px;margin:24px 0;border-radius:6px;">
<div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1b5e20;margin-bottom:8px;">Option 1 · One-click via email reply</div>
<ol style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">
<li>Hit the <strong>Reply</strong> button on this email (your email client's native button)</li>
<li>Type <strong>APPROVE</strong> or <strong>REJECT</strong> on the very first line</li>
<li>Send — Salesforce picks up the keyword and processes the decision automatically</li>
</ol>
<div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:#558b2f;">The keyword <strong>must be on the first line</strong> — before any signature, quoted message, or other text.</div>
</div>

<div style="background:#f4f6f9;border-left:4px solid #37474f;padding:14px 18px;margin:18px 0;font-size:14px;">
<strong>Option 2 · Review in Salesforce</strong> — open the full approval page (line items, account history, audit trail, comments) and click Approve / Reject there.
</div>

<table style="margin:20px 0;width:100%;">
<tr>
<td style="text-align:center;background:#0070D2;border-radius:6px;">
<a href="{!ApprovalRequest.External_URL}"
style="display:block;padding:16px 0;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;">REVIEW IN SALESFORCE</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>

<p style="font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin-top:24px;">
Multi-tier approval matrix: Sales Manager (20-30%) → Finance Director (30-50%) → VP Sales (50%+). Each tier receives a fresh notification once the prior tier approves; you are the assigned approver for this specific step.
</p>
</div>

<div style="background:#f4f6f9;padding:14px 32px;font-size:11px;color:#888888;text-align:center;">
TechStore B2B Quote-to-Cash · Email Approval Response enabled · Keep original headers intact when replying.
</div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
